The post-hoc supplementary experiment executes contemporaneous S0, G0, G*,
FS4, FS8, and FS12 arms on the fixed 38-report evaluation set. Pilot gold
graphs are prompt-visible only in direct-demonstration arms. Evaluation gold
never enters an API payload. Raw provider responses are immutable run outputs;
prediction-only offset normalization is performed by a separate analysis.
