This addendum is deliberately narrower than the historical full held-out runner.
It evaluates three entity-guidance states (S0, E0, E*) and five end-to-end
relation cells.  Two component cells reuse the frozen E* entity inventory so
that R0, R*, and minimal relation instructions can be compared without an
entity-inventory change.  No held-out reference annotation is sent to the API.
"""

